与链路速率共同取限。","summary_truncated":false},{"choice_result":null,"chronology_precision":"date_only","conclusion_correct":null,"correction_refs":null,"correction_result":null,"effective_observed_date":null,"effective_outcome":null,"establishes_independent_mastery":false,"event_kind":"formal_summary","event_time":null,"evidence_refs":[{"source_fragment":"","source_id":"CN_UNK_053","source_kind":"formal_summary","source_sha256":"2fec2ee36fabb57f083bea807f03bc919acb679a768d520ab6a71df7ee35c099"}],"evidence_role":"formal_summary","formal_ids":["CN_UNK_053"],"knowledge_point":"CN03-11","observed_date":"2026-08-28","outcome":null,"point_binding":"question_associated","prompt_dependency":"unknown","reasoning_result":null,"record_key":"KLR-7e03a16271a15beb81664bcb75ed53bd67704c3ca074480e03ee82d28772e6ff","review_marker":null,"source_access":null,"source_available":null,"source_fragment":"","source_id":"CN_UNK_053","source_kind":"formal_summary","source_locator":"","source_order":null,"source_sha256":"2fec2ee36fabb57f083bea807f03bc919acb679a768d520ab6a71df7ee35c099","summary":"混淆仍可发送数量与发送窗口总大小，没有把窗口上限与序号位数关系落实。 2026-07-13 复做再次错误：能正确识别累计确认，但把还能新发的帧数误当成发送窗口总大小，未将尚未确认的在途帧计入已占窗口位置；同时把循环序号窗口误解为可从已确认序号中任意选择。经纠偏后已能先用未确认数加可新发数确定发送窗口大小，再检查 GBN 序号空间约束。 2026-07-16 晨间复盘再次错误：累计确认后未保留已发送未确认帧对发送窗口的占位，把整个滑动后的窗口都当成可新发范围，并混淆新发与超时重传。 2026-07-18 复做再次错误：把已发送未确认帧仍当作可发送位置，并把窗口内后续新帧的发送误称为重传 2026-08-28 晨间复盘首答中等置信错误：累计确认与窗口移动前半正确，但把 GBN 接收窗口误当成与发送窗口同宽，并据此扩大序号空间；经提示区分 GBN 接收窗口为 1 与 SR 乱序缓存后完成纠正，…","summary_truncated":true},{"choice_result":null,"chronology_precision":"date_only","conclusion_correct":null,"correction_refs":null,"correction_result":null,"effective_observed_date":null,"effective_outcome":null,"establishes_independent_mastery":false,"event_kind":"formal_summary","event_time":null,"evidence_refs":[{"source_fragment":"","source_id":"CN_UNK_052","source_kind":"formal_summary","source_sha256":"b4e159c7dc540761bca34ed52e182272febf308ffa01fcef8acf65736a1fde40"}],"evidence_role":"formal_summary","for